Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: Lingmo OS base system miscellaneous files
 This package contains the basic filesystem hierarchy of a Lingmo OS system, and
 several important miscellaneous files, such as /etc/debian_version,
 /etc/host.conf, /etc/issue, /etc/motd, /etc/profile, and others,
 and the text of several common licenses in use on Lingmo OS systems.

Package: base-files
Architecture: all
Depends: lingmo-base-files (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: base system miscellaneous files (empty placeholder)
 This is an intentionally empty package. The actual filesystem hierarchy and
 miscellaneous files are shipped by lingmo-base-files.
 .
 It exists so that anything depending on "base-files" resolves inside the Lingmo
 OS repository instead of pulling Debian's original base-files: a real package
 always wins over a virtual provider, and this one carries an epoch (1:) so its
 version sorts higher than Debian's. It depends on lingmo-base-files, so
 installing it installs the Lingmo implementation.
